Trackdown is an R package for working with google docs

This is mostly an experiment.

The concept is that you can edit an Rmd file (like a notebook) in R, share it on googledrive as a google doc - and **perhaps** make and edit to non-code stuff there and still re-run the code parts.

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/trackdown/vignettes/trackdown-workflow.html